                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "841dd263-e78f-4dee-814c-d5eb0be6866d",
                                "sense_id": "5227fb81-1faa-3844-ad7e-881b4fab2db2",
                                "text": "It made my heart bleed; but the men had a great respect for the chief mate, who was, as they said, \"the only seaman of the whole jing-bang, and none such a bad man when he was sober.\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5a178446-c8bf-40b1-b6c6-35f926764543",
                                "sense_id": "5227fb81-1faa-3844-ad7e-881b4fab2db2",
                                "text": "Bloom was pointing out all the stars and the comets in the heavens to Chris Callinan and the jarvey: the great bear and Hercules and the dragon, and the whole jingbang lot."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "40b7044c-e4a5-41c9-be7c-8e9d889cef61",
                                "sense_id": "5227fb81-1faa-3844-ad7e-881b4fab2db2",
                                "text": "And he called them Bloody Scotch savages, and was in an awful rage and at the term-time he had them sacked, the whole jing-bang of them, so sore affronted he had been."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
